{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">If <math alttext=\"2 left parenthesis 5 x right parenthesis equals 6\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>, what is the value of <math alttext=\"5 x\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>?</p>", "keys": ["6573a89a-23c0-41b5-a6ab-9890d98eb50a"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "ab0d3d34-59bc-46ac-b2c3-4bcef496be6e", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"four fifths\"><mfrac>\n\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t<mn>5</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "190e2cf4-5894-4922-866c-2ec7b2d19d12", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"five thirds\"><mfrac>\n\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t<mn>3</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "6573a89a-23c0-41b5-a6ab-9890d98eb50a", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "13bc3246-7421-46ec-bdcd-7eb65b46e7bb", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn>\n</math></p>"}], "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is correct. Dividing both sides of the given equation by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"2\"><mn>2</mn></math> yields <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"5 x equals 3\"><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>. Therefore, the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"5 x\"><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn></math>.</p>\n<p>Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p>Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p>Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>", "externalid": "f0727bf9-4765-47a5-ad90-ee9cc0ed3794", "correct_answer": ["C"]}